= BerryTree_EventScript_CheckSoil
lock
faceplayer
specialvar VAR_RESULT PlayerHasBerries
goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT TRUE BerryTree_EventScript_WantToPlant
msgbox	It's soft, loamy soil.
waitmessage
waitbuttonpress
release
end
= BerryTree_EventScript_WantToPlant
msgbox	It's soft, loamy soil. Want to plant a BERRY?
goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT YES BerryTree_EventScript_ChooseBerryToPlant
goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT NO BerryTree_EventScript_CancelPlanting
end
= BerryTree_EventScript_CancelPlanting
release
end
= BerryTree_EventScript_ChooseBerryToPlant
fadescreen FADE_TO_BLACK
closemessage
special Bag_ChooseBerry
goto_if_eq VAR_ITEM_ID 0 BerryTree_EventScript_CancelPlanting
removeitem VAR_ITEM_ID
call BerryTree_EventScript_PlantBerry
goto BerryTree_EventScript_CancelPlanting
= BerryTree_EventScript_PlantBerry
special ObjectEventInteractionPlantBerryTree
incrementgamestat GAME_STAT_PLANTED_BERRIES
special IncrementDailyPlantedBerries
special ObjectEventInteractionGetBerryCountString
msgbox	PLAYER planted one STR_VAR_1 in the soft, loamy soil.
waitmessage
waitbuttonpress
return
= BerryTree_EventScript_Sparkling
lockall
msgbox	!
waitmessage
waitbuttonpress
releaseall
end
= Route104_EventScript_ExpertF
lock
faceplayer
goto_if_set FLAG_RECEIVED_CHESTO_BERRY_ROUTE_104 Route104_EventScript_ReceivedBerry
msgbox	Wenn du BERRIES siehst, die in lockerem Boden wachsen, nimm sie dir ruhig.Aber pflanz auf jeden Fall eine BERRY an derselben Stelle wieder ein. Das gehört sich einfach so.Hier, das teile ich mit dir.
giveitem ITEM_CHESTO_BERRY
goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT FALSE Common_EventScript_ShowBagIsFull
setflag FLAG_RECEIVED_CHESTO_BERRY_ROUTE_104
msgbox	So wie du aussiehst, bist du bestimmt ein TRAINER, oder?TRAINER lassen ihre POKéMON oft BERRIES tragen.Es liegt bei dir, ob du BERRIES anbaust oder sie benutzt.
release
end
